1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
[Title]

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:15,385
There is a beautiful, fluffy orange cat.
The cat sits by the kitchen door. He
looks up with big, curious eyes. His
food bowl is empty.

3
00:00:15,385 --> 00:00:24,930
The cat jumps onto a kitchen chair. He
is still looking at the empty bowl. A
person stands nearby and smiles,
surprised.

4
00:00:24,930 --> 00:00:34,780
The person pours cat food into the bowl.
The cat watches excitedly. The kitchen
is cozy with warm colors and a few
plants.

5
00:00:34,780 --> 00:00:42,569
The cat is happily eating from the bowl.
Food is scattered everywhere. The person
watches and laughs, feeling happy.

6
00:00:42,569 --> 00:00:53,260
The cat is lying contentedly on the
floor. He has a full belly. The person
sits on the couch and reads a book. He
looks at the cat and smiles.

